&lt;p&gt;Prepare for obligations that come with new locations, headcount thresholds, or new regulations, partnering with Legal to understand them and design solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage an HR compliance calendar to track compliance programs and deadlines globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
