&lt;li&gt;Have exceptional communication skills with ability to work effectively across cultural contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate cultural sensitivity and ability to navigate complex stakeholder relationships across regions and time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with data-driven recruiting and metrics-based performance tracking in international contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand nuances of hiring practices, employment law, and professional norms in Singapore&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience working with distributed teams across significant time zone differences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong candidates may also:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
