&lt;p&gt;Have been a trusted advisor to founders and CEOs, and enjoy working closely with them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Know when co-marketing will create real value for both companies, and when it won&#39;t&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
