&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager in the Internal Products and Technologies organization, you&#39;ll own the experiences our sales teams use to configure, price, quote, approve, and close deals. You’ll partner with Engineering, Sales, Deal Operations, Finance, and Legal to shape how customers buy from Anthropic. You’ll balance a fast, simple seller experience with rigorous governance.&lt;/p&gt;
