&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply understand sellers, Deal Desk, Legal, and Order Management workflows and how tooling can improve their impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product strategy and roadmap for quoting, approvals, and deal execution, using AI wherever it makes the experience meaningfully better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering to design and ship the systems behind quoting, pricing, and approvals, and own adoption as well as launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make prioritization calls across competing stakeholder needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
