&lt;p&gt;Recruiting is a key driver to Fin’s success. As a Recruiting Coordinator at Fin, you’ll act as a first impression for the company and partner closely with recruiters, hiring managers, and cross-functional stakeholders to deliver an optimal candidate interview experience. This position will support our global team to efficiently navigate complex scheduling requests and last-minute changes. Along with scheduling interviews, our Recruiting Coordinators are responsible for supporting recruiting related initiatives and overall system maintenance. We currently operate in a hybrid working model and have offices in San Francisco, Chicago, Dublin, London, Berlin and Sydney. You will be expected to be in the office in Dublin at least 3 days a week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the end-to-end interview scheduling process, including candidate communication, interview panel coordination, and room booking. Ensure a smooth interview experience for candidates and interviewers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support recruiters and hiring panels by opening, organising, and maintaining recruitment data in our ATS. Generate reports and provide data insights as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the main point of contact for candidates throughout the hiring process. Continuously seek ways to improve the candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate in-person / on-site interviews, including greeting candidates, preparing interview spaces, and ensuring a welcoming office experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with posting job openings on various job boards and Fin&#39;s careers page. Ensure job descriptions are up-to-date and attractive to potential candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with maintaining recruitment-related documents, templates, prep guides, and processes. Help streamline and optimise recruitment operations, including organising recruitment events, managing recruitment campaigns, and coordinating with external vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Fin’s mission, vision, and values with integrity, and help us attract AI-enthusiasts who are excited to shape the future of customer service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
