&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail, high sense of urgency, and prioritisation and multi-tasking skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Affinity for improving and caring for the candidate experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in multiple tools and systems: GSuite, Microsoft office and applicant tracking systems&lt;/li&gt;
